          What First-Time Homeowners in Denver Should Know Before Their First Big Move
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-white/90">
          Your first home purchase in Denver is one of the biggest financial decisions of your life. The move itself is the part most people underestimate — here's what to expect and how to get through it without the headaches that catch most first-timers off guard.
